KaiBoard — Third-Party Licenses
================================

KaiBoard is built on top of the following open-source projects. We are grateful
to their authors and maintainers.

Note on scope: only libraries that KaiBoard actually depends on / builds upon
are listed here. Projects that were merely *referenced for inspiration* during
design (and then independently re-implemented) are NOT listed, because no part
of their code ships in this repository.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Excalidraw  (runtime dependency — drawing kernel)
- Package : @excalidraw/excalidraw  (v0.18.1)
- License : MIT
- Source  : https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw
- Copyright (c) Excalidraw and its contributors

KaiBoard uses Excalidraw's canvas / drawing kernel. The surrounding "shell"
(sidebar file-tree, local & folder storage, trash, comments, Agent co-draw,
multi-board management) is original work. Excalidraw's promotional links
(blog / YouTube) and brand were removed from the product UI; its MIT license
text is preserved here and in ./LICENSE.

## @excalidraw/mermaid-to-excalidraw  (runtime dependency — Mermaid import)
- Package : @excalidraw/mermaid-to-excalidraw  (v2.2.2)
- License : MIT
- Source  : https://github.com/excalidraw/mermaid-to-excalidraw

## React / React DOM  (runtime dependency — UI)
- Package : react / react-dom  (v18)
- License : MIT
